### 富文本渲染证据

**文件**：`pages/aiChat/index.vue`
**关键代码**：

```javascript
// 第194-218行：formatTextWithBold 函数
function formatTextWithBold(text) {
  const regex = /\*\*(.*?)\*\*/g  // 匹配 **加粗文本**
  let segments1 = ''
  let lastIndex = 0
  let match

  while ((match = regex.exec(text)) !== null) {
    segments1 += text.substring(lastIndex, match.index)
    segments1 += `<strong>${match[1]}</strong>`
    lastIndex = match.index + match[0].length
  }

  return segments1
}
```

